// Out of the suit she climbs as she does in it (avatars/moth-climb.puck), on the stamina wheel the suit's climb declares,
// so a rope net (the gallery toybox's net panel) is a climb either way. A document of its own, which suit.puck imports,
// so the climb row composes ahead of the pilot kit's own ground and fall rows, which refill the wheel.
import "../standard/abilities"
climbAbility(kit: "pilot", registers: 0)
